  <h4  class="h4">
          Stage 1 Fire Restrictions enacted
      </h4>
      

            <div class="text-long"><p>Effective beginning 12:01 a.m. Friday, Sept. 4, 2026, until further notice. These restrictions apply to all private land and BLM managed public lands within the boundaries of the Grand Junction Field Office. For more information visit the <a href="https://www.mesacounty.us/departments-and-services/sheriff/divisions/emergency-services/fire-restrictions">Fire Restrictions webpage</a>.</p>
